---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
	<section class="hero">
		<p class="eyebrow">Personal Homepage</p>
		<p class="name">김서영 <span>Hamo</span></p>
		<h1>Swift를 배우고 기록하는 Hamo입니다.</h1>
		<p class="intro">
			더 쉽게, 더 깊게 읽는 Swift velog를 통해 배움의 행복을 전달하고
			있습니다.
		</p>
		<div class="actions" aria-label="Main links">
			<a class="primary-link" href="/about/">About에서 더 알아보기</a>
			<a href="/projects/">Projects 보기</a>
			<a href="/posts/">Posts 읽기</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="interests" aria-labelledby="interests-title">
		<h2 id="interests-title">관심 분야</h2>
		<p>iOS, Swift, 교육, 배움을 중심으로 공부하고 기록합니다.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="site-guide" aria-labelledby="site-guide-title">
		<h2 id="site-guide-title">어디로 이동하면 좋을까요?</h2>
		<div class="section-grid">
			<article>
				<h3>About</h3>
				<p>처음 방문했다면 여기에서 김서영과 Hamo를 먼저 알아볼 수 있습니다.</p>
				<a href="/about/">About 페이지로 이동</a>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3>Projects</h3>
				<p>앞으로 만든 프로젝트와 배운 점을 카드 형태로 정리할 예정입니다.</p>
				<a href="/projects/">Projects 페이지로 이동</a>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3>Posts</h3>
				<p>Swift 학습 기록과 글 중심 콘텐츠를 모아둘 예정입니다.</p>
				<a href="/posts/">Posts 페이지로 이동</a>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.hero {
		max-width: 46rem;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		color: #4d6f92;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.name {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		color: #2a2d31;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.name span {
		margin-left: 0.5rem;
		color: #717982;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	h1 {
		max-width: 15ch;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 7vw, 6rem);
		line-height: 1.05;
		word-break: keep-all;
	}

	.intro {
		max-width: 37rem;
		margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
		color: #4b535c;
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 2.25rem;
	}

	.actions a {
		border: 1px solid #d9dde2;
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		background: #ffffff;
		color: #2f363d;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.actions a:hover {
		border-color: #4d6f92;
		color: #294e75;
	}

	.actions .primary-link {
		border-color: #2f363d;
		background: #202124;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.actions .primary-link:hover {
		border-color: #294e75;
		background: #294e75;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.interests,
	.site-guide {
		margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
		border-top: 1px solid #e6e8eb;
		padding-top: 2rem;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}

	.interests p {
		max-width: 38rem;
		margin: 0;
		color: #59616b;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		word-break: keep-all;
	}

	.section-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	article {
		border-top: 1px solid #e6e8eb;
		padding-top: 1rem;
	}

	h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	article p {
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
		color: #59616b;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	article a {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: #294e75;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
	}

	article a:hover {
		color: #202124;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		h1 {
			max-width: 13ch;
			font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 14vw, 4rem);
		}

		.name span {
			display: block;
			margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
		}

		.section-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
